# FABLE-SONNET-RECEIVE-RENAME-20260924-166 commit 1: `nextMessage` is no longer a language word --
# the mail receiver is `receiveMessage` (author, LMX_blog/2026-09-24.md; design steps/mail-wrappers.md).
# `nextMessage: m` is now an ordinary colon-assignment to an undeclared name (measured: this shape
# refuses as "assignment target must be a declared typed mutable value", not "unknown method").
fn: test () int
    nextMessage: m
    return: 0
end: test

return: test()
